<th><strong>Role in the minimalist system</strong></th>
<th><strong>Material or structure choices</strong></th>
<th><strong>Insert or interior variation options</strong></th>
<th><strong>Process benefit for the team</strong></th>
<th><strong>Example use in real projects</strong></th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>Outer box footprint group</td>
<td>Controls how products share shippers and shelves</td>
<td>Three to six key footprints in board grades</td>
