<th><strong>Practical actions taken</strong></th>
<th><strong>Outcome for future shipments</strong></th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>Initial diy trials</td>
<td>Learn how boxes behave</td>
<td>How long does this set-up hold</td>
