<td>Standard wrap and basic strapping</td>
<td>Nearby cross-border deliveries and B2B supply</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Long mixed land and sea routes</td>
<td>Higher grade export designs</td>
<td>Corner protection and bracing</td>
<td>Strong wrap and careful load plans</td>
<td>Container loads to distant distribution hubs</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Remote or high-risk destinations</td>
<td>Top tier heavy duty crate range</td>
<td>Full blocking, bracing, and pads</td>
<td>Extra straps and route markings</td>
<td>Critical machinery, service parts, key spares</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
